# Traffic Sign Recognition

## Problem
Identifying traffic signs quickly from images can be difficult, especially when there are many different types of signs.

## Objective
The objective of this project is to recognize different traffic signs from images using a CNN-based image classification system.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- PyTorch
- Torchvision
- CNN
- NumPy
- Matplotlib

## Project Workflow

Image Input  
↓  
Image Preprocessing  
↓  
CNN Model  
↓  
Training  
↓  
Testing  
↓  
Prediction

## Methodology
The traffic sign images were resized and converted into tensors before being given to the CNN model. The model was trained using traffic sign images and then tested on separate test images.

## Result
The trained CNN model was tested on traffic sign images and successfully generated predictions for different traffic sign categories.

## Future Improvements
- Train the model using the complete dataset
- Improve classification accuracy
- Add real-time traffic sign recognition using a camera
- Deploy the model as a web application
